th\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Each person is counted only once during a calendar year.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Transmission from a patient with dracunculiasis is contained if all of the following conditions are met\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}